watch hangin' at his waist.

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:31.700
<b>Wrap it up! 
Time is money!</b>

00:24:31.700 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:31.700 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>K</b>

